      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hazel-Atlas Glass Company operated the world’s largest tumbler factory in Clarksburg, employing more than 1,000 people by 1920.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
